meta {
  name: library summary (scoring input)
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{collection_url}}/library/summary
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The deduplicated game library that feeds recommendation scoring:
  two copies of the same game collapse to one row with the best
  rating. Entries with an IGDB game identity are included; custom
  games gain identity from their pricing proxy target, product-backed
  games from their product.
}
